# Allowlist prevents secrets, local binaries, databases and caches entering builds.
**
!Dockerfile
!requirements.lock.txt
!daybrief/
!daybrief/*.py
!daybrief/assets/
!daybrief/assets/anchor_neutral.png
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/.next/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
